    "scenesThatPass": [
      "ANNE: May we come in..?\nANNE: Look at you..! Younger than me. More beautiful than me. Married before me. I am eclipsed. I am just the `Other Boleyn Girl.'\nMARY: Hardly.",
      "ANNE: Are you nervous?\nMARY: A little.\nANNE: You'll tell me everything in the morning?\nMARY: I promise.",
      "ANNE: I am forever in your debt.\nMARY: You owe me nothing, sister. I did it that we may finally draw a line beneath everything that has happened between us.\nANNE: hen let it be exactly that. A new start between us. Here at court.\nMARY: Thank you. But I'd rather go back to our home in the country.",
      "MARY: So, it's true. It's really happening?\nANNE: Yes, it is. Stay with me, please? I need my sister by me side.",
      "MIDWIFE: And again, one more..\nMIDWIFE: It's done, your Majesty..!\nMARY: Well done...\nANNE: And..?"
    ]
  },
